{"id":"cb62be5b9aab48d1","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-diagonalizable-system.md","title":"Diagonalizable Arithmetic System","display":"df-diagonalizable-system — Diagonalizable Arithmetic System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-diagonalizable-system","aliases":["92-df-diagonalizable-system"],"display":"df-diagonalizable-system — Diagonalizable Arithmetic System","source":"第 VIII 章 pp. 102–103；第 IX 章 p. 108（PDF 119–120、125）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-arithmetic-system]]","[[92-df-formula-instance]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-provable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-diagonalizable-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-diagonalizable-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-diagonalizable-system — Diagonalizable Arithmetic System"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VIII 章 pp. 102–103；第 IX 章 p. 108（PDF 119–120、125）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"62f011418ee9c44e\" href=\"?note=62f011418ee9c44e\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-system\">92-df-arithmetic-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd18c4d476f594a\" href=\"?note=8bd18c4d476f594a\" title=\"92-df-formula-instance\">92-df-formula-instance</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1\">\\(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1\\)</span> 是<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8bd18c4d476f594a\" href=\"?note=8bd18c4d476f594a\" title=\"92-df-formula-instance\">92-df-formula-instance</a>的实例操作；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Diagonalizable}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Diagonalizable}_G\\)</span> 是下文定义的内部固定点性质。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonalizable\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Diagonalizable}_G(\\mathcal S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\bigl(X\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(F;\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})\\bigr)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonalizable\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Diagonalizable}_G(\\mathcal S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\bigl(X\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(F;\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是内部的、可证等价意义下的固定点性质。强可定义的对角函数是原书给出的充分条件；仅有外部可计算函数或语义 Gödel 句存在不是同义条件。本地 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的标准对角构造提供此性质。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VIII 章 pp. 102–103；第 IX 章 p. 108（PDF 119–120、125）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-system","status":"resolved","id":"62f011418ee9c44e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula-instance","status":"resolved","id":"8bd18c4d476f594a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula-instance]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula-instance","status":"resolved","id":"8bd18c4d476f594a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1$ 是[[92-df-formula-instance]]的实例操作；$\\mathrm{Diagonalizable}_G$ 是下文定义的内部固定点性质。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Diagonalizable}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}diagonalizable\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Diagonalizable}_G(\\mathcal S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists X\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\bigl(X\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1(F;\\overline{\\ulcorner X\\urcorner})\\bigr)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1558,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma]]与[[92-df-diagonalizable-system]]是内部可证等价的固定点，与第 I 章仅谈真值的 Gödel 句分别使用。"},{"id":"02627be788793195","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"115b0689f1a67703","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fd30fbde88ab93eb","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"57ea3ea286817df3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-105","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-diagonalizable-system]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-diagonalizable-system]]"}],"outgoing":["62f011418ee9c44e","8bd18c4d476f594a","90f32e29c9d553ed","2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","b78092e29a02d697","51c43e0240787ebb"]}